Sun Aug  9 06:59:26 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.7.0
  * Update Brent's tables of factors of `b^k +/- 1`. maintained by
    Jonathan Crombie. The full collection has grown to over 280 MB,
    which is too much to distribute; the tables shipped with
    FactInt are therefore restricted to those `(b,k)` with `b <=
    100`, or `b` a prime below 1000, or `(b,k)` already covered by
    FactInt 1.6.3. Use the `FetchBrentFactors` function to install
    the full collection.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
